# Gemini API key — required for live AI lessons, vocabulary, quizzes, and the Dialogue Coach.
# Get one free at https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#
# This is OPTIONAL: without a key the app still works fully offline using the
# bundled content (vocabulary, lessons, and quizzes for every CEFR level A1–C2).
# The Dialogue Coach is the only feature that strictly requires a key.
#
# NOTE: In a pure client-side build the key is exposed in the browser. For a
# public deployment, proxy Gemini calls through a small backend instead of
# shipping the key. See README "Security" section.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
